# package.json + pnpm-lock.yaml + pnpm-workspace.yaml are intentionally
# tracked: the project keeps `playwright` as a single devDependency for
# the cross-browser smoke test in scripts/cross-browser.js. The pnpm
# store itself is NOT in OneDrive — see pnpm-workspace.yaml `storeDir`
# and D:\apps\onedrive\<user>\OneDrive\dev\setups\README.md.

